---
interface Props {
  noteNumber?: string;
  date?: string;
  readingTime?: string;
  title?: string;
  href?: string;
}

const {
  noteNumber = "No. 04",
  date = "March 14, 2026",
  readingTime = "6 min",
  title = "On choosing what not to do.",
  href = "/notes",
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="section section--paper section--xl operator-note" id="featured-note">
  <div class="container container--editorial">
    <div class="operator-note__grid">
      <aside class="operator-note__aside">
        <span class="t-label operator-note__label">Note · {noteNumber}</span>
        <span class="t-mono operator-note__meta">{date}</span>
        <span class="t-mono operator-note__meta">Reading time {readingTime}</span>
      </aside>

      <article class="operator-note__body">
        <h2 class="t-hero operator-note__title">{title}</h2>
        <p class="t-body-lg">
          A focused company is one that has chosen what not to do, and has the patience to keep
          choosing. That patience is the actual scarce resource. It is not capital, not insight,
          not even people — though all three matter. It is the discipline to keep saying no.
        </p>
        <p class="t-body-lg">
          At Highstack we measure our businesses on five things: clarity of thesis, quality of
          customer relationships, cash conversion, the moral seriousness of the operators, and the
          smallness of the team relative to the size of the opportunity. The last point matters
          more than people realize.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="t-quote operator-note__quote">
          We would rather own one business for thirty years than ten for three.
        </blockquote>
        <p class="t-body-lg">
          The companies inside Highstack are not connected by industry. They are connected by a
          shared operating philosophy and a shared time horizon. That is enough.
        </p>
        <div class="operator-note__foot">
          <span class="t-label operator-note__byline">— Founder, Highstack</span>
          <a href={href} class="btn btn--ghost">
            Read all notes <span class="arrow"></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .operator-note__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 200px 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-9);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .operator-note__aside {
    position: sticky;
    top: 120px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--s-2);
  }
  .operator-note__label {
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
  }
  .operator-note__meta {
    color: var(--fg-tertiary);
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .operator-note__body {
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .operator-note__title {
    margin: 0 0 var(--s-7);
    font-size: clamp(36px, 4.4vw, 64px);
  }
  .operator-note__body p {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: var(--s-5);
  }
  .operator-note__quote {
    border-left: 2px solid var(--hs-yellow);
    margin: var(--s-7) 0;
    padding-left: var(--s-5);
  }
  .operator-note__foot {
    margin-top: var(--s-8);
    padding-top: var(--s-5);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--s-4);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .operator-note__byline {
    color: var(--fg-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .operator-note__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--s-5);
    }
    .operator-note__aside {
      position: static;
      flex-direction: row;
      gap: var(--s-4);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }
</style>
